        => 'Protection and delivery: all pages are delivered via Cloudflare (Cloudflare, Inc., USA; in the EU Cloudflare Germany GmbH) in order to fend off attacks. In the process, the IP address and technical connection data are processed; a transfer to the USA is possible (basis: EU-US Data Privacy Framework or standard contractual clauses; data processing agreement pursuant to Art. 28 GDPR).',
